  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Tech sphere, Drone.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Drones you create gain the Athletics sphere as a bonus talent. If the drone already possess the Athletics sphere, they instead gain a bonus talent from the Athletics sphere. In addition, each drone is created with Acrobatics, Climb, Fly, and Swim as class skills.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat may be taken multiple times, each time granting an additional talent from the Athletics sphere.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc114\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
